---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-94-energy-materials-manufacturing-logistics-strategic-supply-chain-transformation-registry.json";
const utilities = registry.energy_water_industrial_utility_reliability_dossiers;
const materials = registry.minerals_materials_processing_circularity_qualification_ledgers;
const manufacturing = registry.manufacturing_equipment_automation_maintenance_quality_accepted_production_registers;
const supplyChains = registry.logistics_inventory_strategic_reserves_emergency_conversion_supply_chain_resilience_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Energy, Materials, Manufacturing, Logistics And Strategic Supply Chains | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive industrial-utility, qualified-material, accepted-production, and supply-chain-resilience records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-energy-materials-manufacturing-supply-chain-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Physical Economy</div><h1 class="page-title">Installed capacity is not delivered reliable energy, and a factory announcement is not accepted production.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 94 traces industrial energy, water and utilities; mineral and material processing, qualification and circularity; factories, equipment, automation, maintenance, quality and accepted production; then logistics, inventory, strategic reserves, emergency conversion, resilient access, technology sovereignty and just industrial transition.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive utility dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive material ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive manufacturing registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive supply-chain ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 physical-economy decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Energy, Water And Industrial Utilities</div><h2>Eight reliability dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/energy-generation-grid-fuels-storage-reliability-001/">Read the energy reliability guide</a></div><div class="grid">{utilities.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.energy_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/energy-materials-manufacturing-supply-chains/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Resources, assets, networks, demand, delivery, reliability, affordability, restoration, environment, distribution, review and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Minerals, Materials, Processing And Circularity</div><h2>Eight material ledgers contain no qualification decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/material-qualification-traceability-standards-circularity-001/">Read the material qualification guide</a></div><div class="grid">{materials.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.materials_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/energy-materials-manufacturing-supply-chains/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.minerals_materials_processing_circularity_qualification_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Resources, recovery, processing, assays, standards, certification, customer qualification, traceability, circularity and public value remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Factories, Equipment, Maintenance, Quality And Accepted Production</div><h2>Eight manufacturing registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/accepted-production-quality-yield-reliability-001/">Read the accepted-production guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{manufacturing.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/energy-materials-manufacturing-supply-chains/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.manufacturing_equipment_automation_maintenance_quality_accepted_production_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Factories, lines, tooling, automation, commissioning, production, yield, quality, maintenance, workforce, customer acceptance and field reliability remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.manufacturing_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Logistics, Inventories, Reserves And Supply-Chain Resilience</div><h2>Eight strategic supply-chain ledgers contain no resilience decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/strategic-reserves-emergency-conversion-mutual-aid-001/">Read the reserves and conversion guide</a></div><div class="grid">{supplyChains.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/energy-materials-manufacturing-supply-chains/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.logistics_inventory_strategic_reserves_emergency_conversion_supply_chain_resilience_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Orders, inventories, shipments, supplier tiers, modes, nodes, access, reserves, allocation, conversion, mutual aid, sovereignty, transition and restoration remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.supply_chain_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty physical-economy state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without treating installed capacity as delivered energy, resources as qualified supply, announcements as accepted production, throughput as resilient access, domestic content as sovereignty, or a decarbonization target as just transition—and without allocating, qualifying, accepting, releasing, converting, scoring, ranking, or changing a stage.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/energy-materials-manufacturing-logistics-strategic-supply-chain-transformation.json">Energy, materials, manufacturing and supply-chain JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
